# Stilwell Farms renovation style: LOG CABIN (rustic mountain lodge).
# Stacked round logs with cut log ends at the corners, dark green standing-seam metal roofs,
# stone chimneys, lit (ORANGE) windows, plank porches. 3/4 view, top-left light, colour 3 outlines.
# Doors are in the bottom-middle cell touching the bottom edge. Grass is copied from the GRASS meta.

